  "id": "section-930",
  "title": "关于中央各部运动的指示",
  "level": 0,
  "sourceUrl": "https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/5-310.htm",
  "html": "<table><tbody><tr><td> -&gt;  -&gt; <a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/index.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">1968年汉版《毛泽东思想万岁》</a><hr>\n<b>310)</b>\n\n\n<br>\n<br>\n　　“全国的形势比我们预料的要慢，中央各部要慢。”开始说三、四月出眉目，前几天主席说“比预料的晚了一个季度，不是三、四、五月了，而是六、七月了。与其估计快一点，不如估计慢一点，与其估计很容易，不如估计困难一点。’<br><br><hr><p><a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/5-309.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">上一页</a>　<a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/index.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">目录</a>　<a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/5-311.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">下一页</a><br><br></p></td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n"
}
